I solved the problem using "distinct" for the first 4 columns and keeping the 5th.

me = distinct(me, camera.location, site.name <http://site.name>, season, variable, .keep_all = TRUE)

mec = dcast(me, camera.location + site.name <http://site.name> ~ season + variable)

Manuel

